Package: netmapperv1
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Netmapper Contributors <netmapper@example.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_VERSION@)
Description: independent bounded TCP and UDP network scanner
 Netmapper resolves IPv4 and IPv6 targets and provides a bounded built-in
 scanner with optional TCP banner collection, JSON output, and full-port scans.